  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Europe Floods 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Severe floods in September 2024 brought by Storm Boris have affected communities in multiple Central and Eastern European countries.&#xa0;The disaster has damaged homes and whole communities, caused power outages, and led to widespread evacuations. Whilst the floods have receded, thousands of people remain in temporary shelters and even those able to return home return to living conditions of high risk to their health. Households will need to be cleaned up, debris removed, and support provided to avoid waterborne diseases. Beyond the urgent practical needs, we know that recovery takes time, and those affected will need emotional support too as they process and heal from the psychological impacts of the disaster.</narrative>
  </description>
